  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "路多枳棘，步刺我足。不利旅客，為心作毒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:930fc18361d898c806db51fc7a379de946a2dd7dbd6e8dbef572f476d42968bd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dca6d263900f80d6dc089138001f74b63022035639546540ce4616ddc40f4e6c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "鯉鮪鮒鯽，積福多魚。資所無有，富我窮家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f9de6583dcdecc5bc926fbd13db39a59727a5cc94bb215e3dd1bb9a9b3bcad03",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bca01ec0d765d05f046333cd9c7654d6cd6d838bfd283a7f16e02f904ae0221f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "景星照堂，麟遊鳳翔。仁施大行，頌聲作興。仁序無明，失其寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b4573883811937eede3036335d24c108c1dc76880d9daa86e34a59a2c24b7707",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:933ea289b5756209ee457efb93a71192c98dd4e429a83182224fdbee275ab990"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "羊腸九縈，相推稍前。止須王孫，乃能至天。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a66981e69ebba6dfe777b6557dc57333178e2662cf130de998320c800addfc31",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf3ea1d901a0732d77e84205f18bc259706198bf18dc4157cd4566f663fd7502"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "四手共身，莫失所圖。更相訪接，動失事便。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db7a72b0ecdf9979b70bd47bf09b63c82a7459a4fee708a62fba37bcd9bd1755",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:31fc7552c821bc18308c27223c796a532560956d1d5e779bb1c834fa3ac84af3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "水流趨下，逮至東來。求我所有，買鱣與鯉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be38024d254c84f5889c5d5b6f76b4f6d39acea28d82666254b1c923ac2528ee",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e3f880332fb9021239e8a59a1fbd767b8d8ab1f2308193c74b5e42510908fca6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "春栗夏棗，山鮮希有。斗千萬石，貴不可賤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6156450bba8691ff9803355f58f092ade84e0e6630b35f74938e9e4aafbdbef",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2419b906d91dc12d87b822b4517ea4251b64aad57e79c1f14b287b06f1acc4f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "旦往暮還，相佑與聚，無有凶患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:91940e3e6ddbd7627f4ddb94303ef913542b732c32d3856133a4338b03834bd0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4e099d93e1769e682c7f6f44b3f8e708602de4c0514a031df53926a1dfae220e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "大蛇當路，使季畏懼。湯火之災，切直我膚。賴其天幸，歸于室廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:398132efefb135ec961dd70719ff152055d8083c0f14f9cfb723630fd7ba8d05",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0a7e5995afab7312fc96eb4373ab162f2e5ca7b9da39653773bea4047933a39b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "徒足去域，亂入陳國。有所畏避，深藏邃匿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:913d0138c5249b5ad75f606e33590ab0a4b1c44ca21773ca10960327758502be",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4b61194f6f44c59c59bb0f0496e72ae7bd9f31e5da325c54b8e189d320eefe52"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "海為水宗，聰明且聖。百流歸得，無有叛逆。常饒優足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:39cbc28a5591855a1fddbc4c73686c0abd18937f339b295f07637df88541fcdb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fedbe2384a986c3733f9761c93719656e186cbe7d616692ab93e0ce52cbb9fc0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "夏麥麩麯，霜擊其芒。疚君敗國，使年大傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a798a8dc5a4ad114754ce3724bddac2fb71e0340ff2d0e01e11ef67737699deb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:850b7861885a9a10594000f79e39a113c1a7896861e0be8cd67772e70e5f0030"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "秋隼冬翔，數被履霜。雄犬夜鳴，家憂不寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a46260fc6c6ffd2b0b19be2c2bb6dcb66f37dc872da82724ad0377bc0c6e29ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:07709eecc81011c5f8332605485a8e76636e22df39557f6ba4d5ad0823315ad2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "樂仁上德，東鄰慕梁，來安吾國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c73f31a75874a611888e7e2ac3469ea22b3403b552aac4be5383a3de6a7c789f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:86c870f90753dd6dd1f76ff9d174b576c1f88f08741093aa5b9e80e85ed3f498"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "還憂除殃，污泥上義，下田為江。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a1e004c02b7178d10cf4500ffae0ea7c51ee0c3ade5ec3335e34a523414e508b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:48a565f7ea77c2015c62021521897625668cc8d83bf271002b937e3e7f399574"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "暗昧冥語，傳相詿誤。鬼魅所居，誰知臥處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3c29b2aa37a0a2e293c0152c89efa0d42dde42c6e955c4205b959fb9902d7ec6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1972a3a1cab4d4f3569efbe45d6d1f3728edac0dfbb0e1e3d83cdda465fb12fb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "南歷玉山，東入玉關。登上福堂，飲萬歲漿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:beb2340e94690a18534d582cddc09c69a771db1c19f229483cb68e1f5afab425",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:01af3b4ff0c2735435312f254e708a5635cee340f38f895acaa5d49a6ab19ce3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "比目四翼，來安我國。福善上堂，與我同床。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e9d08e9cbe8218cb270b5680dc2cdc9c1bbd8e74c85a86535d4b56d4dc39563",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5670e9d3b2e701e1a05dd0cc62c946fdc30d3ac6840e87e9cef00b1be5a4e69e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "乘牛逐驥，日暮不至。路宿多畏，亡其騂騅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:346db59729e48bceafe9c03b7eab674443753caf4542dacc261c9bedc3741544",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e112bbe2887b6c883bc56c7b02f4de573ed36069e60ca3b169865a8b15a967a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "元吉無咎，安寧不殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:38d0662832b8002365e45ce69b651c5f67db6ec7f1eeda7fe07ddfb1a8fe288f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:836ad9918d28f50c0407b1cf1a7fa0d300d0585323632e0ada54d6705086b73e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "奮翅鼓翼，翱翔外國。逍遙徙倚，來歸溫室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:65f0dc25d135ceeb0ec267af6ca3c1488315c43df9b213caab3b0b7a6907df31",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be7abe8091986006266c68e63e216e570f1bb2058e838813e5b3c223ba2cf7af"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "河伯娶婦，東山氏女。新婚三日，浮雲洒雨。露我管第，萬邦蒙祐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:586a9de0ad7e1619ea8d1de54f932484871a43a86148b71a267db59496938a6d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cad0bc7a60cd2f998b192d02b3fe393fdf032ff90f41b67cb74b4048b29d6e86"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "嬰兒求乳，慈母歸子。黃麑悅喜，得其甘飽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0758594eaa1756615702a51357991b93a940c8e6aade001d09dded82ae412e67",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:891410dbfe37336d3dc7179c822a2e762f52991fcfde574188ccadc42297ea35"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "貧鬼守門，日破我盆。毀罌傷瓶，空虛無子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:828669c870cd630087d9f849a7323c0730a86f6169150e7d512d2d9e768d8eab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:61722f2e97e549022169a3a970bfeff648ae63d39b6d55c730dc8fdd87af1b51"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "多載重負，捐棄於野。王母誰子，但自勞苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a3686234c2af0b5f1c020925a1d8c2210eb50fb4f110db453a2c586ee8bc1e0c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c0fdb9334530ac551f0de90702a2e3fefd3e53a9ad6841d8e01f26f7fd62eab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "雄狐綏綏，登山崔嵬。昭告顯功，大福允興。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e75c96396b8327dfd3aa891ff5a2cdaae483112043cefda548ac0bb8aecda3c5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dc262ae300e75996f956af0fa2ea733338b213dcefb008117aa2b3a4d21a7886"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "嬰兒駭笑，未有所識。狡童而爭，亂我政事。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ea4dfc5bf7e0609b2cb34587306b8c931645ea0a416decdab17c4afaeb324599",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1969fd32eabbdc5300364f6854f2079180a06fe6f33b09a8e713e2b35053dc00"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "十丸同投，為雉所離。獨得逃脫，完全不虧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:369b56c9dc5d9d498603b7ee529a48fd11f8555875e706b28e518984d467ca17",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:58f4ac0e8f3bd003a60f994a85e9e542368ee3193f4f1731bc27d0c15f4659b8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "狐濟濡尾，來揭得枳。季姜懷悔，鮑舍魚臰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f5477aaf56a13e742ae7674e576f0dda4ebcc9174781d4f797271ee9c8e4f4b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:33ecf0bffb34a259594b6b508607b017559ae14ea963c657ec9cd27485fec0c5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "踆足息肩，所忌不難。金城銅郭，以鐵為關。藩屏周衛，安全無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6338f4ab5ff7e8e33a728395ca4930978865e618ca4d6fbdcecba8ff66dd5f34",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3dea859fe0ae79bf0f3d348a7beebfc82012d72468372890d4acaef8b29d091e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "戴堯扶禹，松喬彭祖。西過王母，道路夷易。無敢難者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fb8d13f228799e8ae9c110123ed121a524f25d5bead16ec3042a2455950cd340",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1e9a7dd2081f3eab8e98557694ac9e8e9fe6f4ae2705fcf5b909b2197297b0c4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "京庾積聚，黍稷以極。行者疾至，可以厭飽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d20a53341342b822457e92f9906790b2d9d92d7c13a4d9e394e418ba6517d06a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c6e3b0a13e4c2eb93fdc6796d1d78c127d0d6c275569087dff5b19e5d068ef5e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "良夫孔姬，負理登臺。欒季不扶，衛輒走逃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:29a7239a279424a0840793be5fbc17be3bd3f16a2b382d508cd1afcbbe85e44f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2f0ea2ba879c59960152cbb41037ab4854cec905cc0d96aeeb02d70d77e890f3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "天之所予，福祿常在，不憂危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:86bec272d5464e3c15641968e4354ee13b8c5fb1f0418b0eadb6c6a7a2c15ed2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e79c0ee11f1c19b6162be713b6a61c55c7b5d78f786d6dddeb0d1d79e879d005"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "行觸天網，馬死車傷。身無寥賴，困窮乏糧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:004e81a6427f2b5d7d5dc0f3a26cad1f0d455c8b93b3acab2fa22a5a543963f9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4e07b57750ad665e919b5d11d3a672ce1da73f245f53f242918b1c07aaca4e6c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "鉛刀切玉，堅不可得。盡我觔力，胝胼為疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:88a1ba4fbe507b63a4e5ffb1353c14b0faea2767c0cd279b6b90302e51895454",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c8dfe08e7aa5293cbb3c0144078d22a23f3d2a2b3771fa55b30ae9072434b551"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "穆逢百里，使孟奮武。將軍帥戰，敗於殽口。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:076768452fccb45e483ac40001a96dc9f201b71defa52454107fc0d6721a9142",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:baf368efb57202a1266e6b1d25eb6f853e787cae40662753d0f091ba46229cb8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "有人追亡，為言所匿，不日而得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b0ed81509fccb3288cbcb7f0f220f982e9cd19b49532162ce9bcb45d6e16d03",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5cd7f57764e6400599df190afdba180b334bfe5ba241eb96edd9d80258126aa0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "府藏之富，玉以振貨。捕魚河海，罟網多得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a6cee41d547afd74a9c795cdcc3d1c80ae923e46b69ed4814bdc9bdfd71a06fe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a4287c855b4f79a172761f4ad7f617d39e87147adc2fe600dc4335374c0c7f87"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "鴻飛遵陸，公歸不復，伯氏客宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5ee2c3b9c56fbdbcd941cac23d04f89cbfdfea457a54c5c8d9b3ffe1b9c85a5d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9997d9a1f6ed61d4a6f43867c3146eb11f2d3d06a70b0b841c154ca658b55957"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "鳧過稻蘆，甘樂麩。雖鶩不去，田畯懷憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:71e287b0bfbf6be7beed4ce203bef0c0bf5b0132f1d53455a6f6a1e3c2cb9299",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2e22cdf6ff5afd4157f4fa69d67b4ff8247bc469ae72b3c9a38181000a97c6a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "雨師娶婦，黃岩季子。成禮既婚，相呼而南。膏澤應時，年豐大喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e552329ba51ba80a2548a75f43e7661a22d8ceed6be7427b81a50b69de96a95d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9560cd3512ea2cd9402bdfcafa8491d47d5886293f7b4dcd0353f93d226e567d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "蓄積有餘，糞土不居。美哉輪奐，出有高車。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6926f984f131a2b47d2c2e9da5e884f9a869cbd6926e9f4326b7f5e3960f94bc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5ad9c91a92f9b4b3d2eab0fa3364732e071afb9873f22efc8665b262273b5b6b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "重門擊柝，介士守護。終有他道，雖驚不懼。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8dcb8566cee4b290a93fd249fa3b80191b1f28a5aca1b2b22a5847990577794c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:46a0c567e782ff97777753cd7ffdc762581c7581c2e566ae8f13a3fd53119186"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "大都王市，稠人多寶。公孫宜賈，資貨萬倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fdf2660e15d9c17d28735f10ebc1ea1b8290de975e1976a0d79d43cc9eb9fa4c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:58966be2fe4f4a7544da746a0a6488815da80f6696d84151c93808414bfa1c3c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "秋隼冬翔，數被嚴霜。甲兵庭堂，萬物不生。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e08ef22cbf846ef81f64dd429e29ae153f218f1878e092fa76fd114f3936f0d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:94630c9b35c8199f0621f9503b755fe11651ce0d113c50e5a5ff8427556b0f03"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "招禍致凶，來螫我邦。痛在手足，不得安息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:929a8f94970b3836bd392637c0dc691bc6a8bd771c39892cd99e5447cae20ca8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9418148a69f971430bd54d142a89a1720f8553bfb0a003f5df4ff8b888ea060e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "秦失其鹿，高足先得。勇夫慕義，君子率服。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:556615c0296bdbd410b9a86b976287325408a84a126df1cb64711817ea9afda3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a55333ed384b4f673975410af9dd165599a50677f508a3ca7face05b8506a52"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "山陵四塞，遏我逕路。欲前不得，復還故處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ca47222c4188e474a9ac109efd7df09502f458c90b2b0794accd299cab046ed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:193b091b8f568d5201061d8c197f2e5feaaf406b838bd693285e35aceae2d45c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "一指食肉，口無所得，舌嚵於腹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f7de9200c5354a47fc64f83931df0023134afe4239bc3ab5a04bffca20cecfcb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9404205ee2429c83ac4dea03398a97254f491a41ccc7f54873a94331aa03e9d4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "晨夜驚駭，不知所止。皇母相佑，卒得安處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d35455e56f85998a7f46c1c6caf4ca9f453fc824314d7f4c3a0bbac836120846",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8797fb896683325c76b950e11574b588072b0038b0ce7f2f4586a3e3634bf18"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "擒狼所言，語無成全。設我白馬，使乾口來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:551ed486dfb0d1f15b6f5b7bb653a08b4b0f4334d08f27b32cfa091d1ad6ad47",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5e931e33dd0b2f168e92154cd78b0ec3dcc9a0b3fdf4d1da68a794fe6a1e675b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "呼精靈來，魄生無憂。疾病瘳愈，解我患愁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:afe7552462a579e2af4d05a66bebe8004e9289802333b51ae9127e8821f21162",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:836c10b44a424ae3b6d1b64320936182d96c5c9e03519c9e811ba6c5ad1f27c5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "牧羊逐兔，使魚捕鼠。任非其人，卒歲無功。不免辛苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2c23da8813aa04177ddcc4d65a2246a071f2baff8de5dc3a8e6bc70a70a36a4e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a796b7d0047376be974f5fc765494601c89f0264ed6c8960837073ca4d6d487"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "堂祥上樓，與福俱居。帝姬治好，國安無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8703eed259fcc3e1cd7fe8d2604e225cc8f2368727dc8b1d33de6a47fcc521ed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:542c5282e35c96e027d71c3e1d60680cfb0fdaa091795ec23d9f76e173652fe7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "禹召諸神，會稽南山。執玉萬國，天下康安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:035598b235844ab235ce83cf9877eb53aad898184107eea76d3bb357fadc17f3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6d7cb4b3654f93255755b8580f202b4fa0d3f9bc72b807f74cb125bc99fe6f4f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "太姒文母，仍生聖子。昌發受命，為天下主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:668fff003a4c1008b712faeabc8e75abf2173f8829b5a35a6fd0e6705ce9cf4f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b022f95d8169b83b250aedac53d398c38d3ab68cecbb15d38bd5d9ab4cd2e3ce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "兩罝同室，兔無誰告。與狂相觸，蒙我與惡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e5d2f04066e9c28d42dfe33dac2feb7394e25b88fca6c063e67db1af9a8a59cf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:defad3b5e59f069f39e18f7988d4e83ef909c084d3b77c54d4f7ac9fa0a00df6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "桃雀竊脂，巢於小枝。動搖不安，為風所吹。心寒悚惕，常憂殆危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db67f36a8eacb03819cba192c836907ffb5497edb4eb0d425834dee34df96ec7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd5a49d1d0d99cc86048e0241ca27a2feb7cd931a41e6c021aeddccc09e60b7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "陽春長日，萬物華實，樂有利福。一作春陽盛長，萬物成實。福利所鍾，忻忻過日。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02e71be282eefa49484e0346572e1847b62aa69f230656190e3db572453cd680",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09956a70d85cc53443b4e7fbc62439be6b3b44122b71447d5ea4f51e0b9f7c06"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "鄰不顧我，而望玉女。身疾瘡癩，誰肯媚者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4939794a8d388b4b8fe55159b5f95e715f3a4faccbd239a8437ac03348c5983",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e097b71b1c2bd5da03432d8aa4990a015522f4798093badd8b28eaab8ef36762"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "涸旱不雨，澤竭無流。魚鱉乾口，皇天不憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c7d9885758d952fc35f1c5c777ada0a052dd961a3a8ec18aa9c9823ad131af25",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:61bc4ab73d1b7f0bd0508a2a53394b84df906c3dadac3f7bbd4272b52841b054"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "狼虎之鄉，日爭凶訟。受性貪饕，不能容縱。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e70a5579e1dcb0466e329aef4e19d1912d5b10aff72951328e505147d9f6425d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:85e8f8ff130416f62eda3e0c128b9f18e5d6448fe1c2a8fc6336e6b76d682251"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 41,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "陰住陽疾，水離其室。舟楫大作，傷其黍稷。民飢於食，亦病心腹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e9687a828b6cf4bc8d1ab5b51c250070c64e12db15ff73efc5d26218eab479b8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:66a813f7f6b3b8d997afeaa4a47c08e7ae3bee93eac1492b7cadd4b276af602e"
    }
  ]
}
